+## Peephole (ECR-002)
+
+A Ø25 mm hole through the door tray, door fiber plug and door brick slab, and a Ø32 mm hole
+through the door guard, at chamber mid-height 60 mm right of centre; the tray and guard holes
+are in their DXFs, the fiber plug and brick slab are drilled after bonding. A ceramic plug
+with a handle is a bought part.
+
 ## Open points for quotation
 
 - Standoffs, fasteners, rivet nuts, earth studs, glands, bushes and fiber anchors are stock
