+## Peephole
+
+Look through the peephole only with the plug removed for a moment and wearing eye
+protection rated for infrared; the glare at {{ P["max-temperature"] }} can damage eyesight.
+Replace the {{ part("peephole-plug").name | lower }} at once; never fire with it out.
+
